## RPC Methods

### Health and Runtime

- `health`
- `doctor.run`

### Models

- `models.list`
- `models.install`
- `models.preload`
- `models.catalog`
- `models.refreshCatalog`

Catalog JSON may include `plugins[]`. Plugin install is a CLI file-system action (`vox plugins install`), not an RPC. `voxd` loads `~/.vox/plugins/*/provider.json` at start.

